{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2022-05-26 09:00:00', 'title': "KRAFT HEINZ TO PARTICIPATE IN BERNSTEIN'S 38TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE", 'text': "PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT MIGUEL PATRICIO, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT BERNSTEIN'S 38TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE ON JUNE 2, 2022, AT 4:30 P.M. EASTERN TIME. A LIVE WEBCAST OF THE EVENT WILL BE AVAILABLE AT IR.KRAFTHEINZCOMPANY.COM. A REPLAY WILL BE ACCESSIBLE AFTER THE EVENT THROUGH THE SAME WEBSITE. ABOUT THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY WE ARE DRIVING TRANSFORMATION"}